'''Wise Swordsman''' (明王の剣士, ''Myōō no kenshi'') is an enemy appearing in [[Road to Swordsman Evolution (Easy)|Road to Swordsman Evolution]]. He was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Wise Swordsman
|image = E 222.png
|appearance = [[Road to Swordsman Evolution (Easy)|Road to Swordsman Evolution]]<br>
[[Castle Dragon Great War (Deadly)]]
|money drop = 50円 - 197円
}}

==Enemy==
Even though this enemy is an awakening enemy it has low stats all across the board and could only seem threatening as meatshields for stronger backliner enemies.

